@startuml uc08_capture_observation
title UC-08 — Capture what actually happened, the flywheel (FR-39)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor Recruiter
participant ObservationController as Ctrl
participant InterviewObservationService as Svc
participant InterviewObservationRepository as Repo

Recruiter -> Ctrl : POST /mandates/:id/observations\n{ how it went, questions asked, tone }
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Ctrl : zod-validate
Ctrl -> Svc : record(scope, mandate.client, observation)
activate Svc
Svc -> Svc : derive companyKey from client
Svc -> Repo : add(observation, ownerId = scope)
Repo --> Svc : ok
Svc --> Ctrl : stored
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> Recruiter : 201
deactivate Ctrl
note over Repo : first-party evidence — future prep (UC-05)\nnow overrides the archetype guess for this company
@enduml
